{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1345652-avatar-rating-background","id":1345652,"title":"Avatar Rating background","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-03T15:04:53-08:00","id":1345652,"title":"Avatar Rating background","content":"Hi,<br /> I was wondering what is exactly determining how strong is the connection between the awakened to their avatar...<br /> How one mage would have a stronger connection to his avatar than another.<br /> Couldn't really find it on the book, even though I'm more than sure it should be there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25177-lirbo","name":"Lirbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25177_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T15:58:25-08:00","id":1345657,"title":"","content":"There's no real objective way to determine this. The game leaves a few factors to consider. The avatar itself might be more or less powerful than others, with matching ability to bond to the mage. The mage and their avatar might be at odds with each other on a significant enough level to reduce their bond. Avatars can, in theory, be linked or even shared between people, and it's power is weakened by being spread out. Reality Zones and belief can also interfere with how powerful the bond is as the mage and avatar are caught up in external rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T22:21:08-08:00","id":1345707,"title":"","content":"Note that in one of the books, the rating of the Avatar background was also simply described as how invested an Avatar is in a particular Mage, instead of necessarily describing the actual power and age of the Avatar.<br /> An Avatar rating of 1 could mean an ancient, powerful Avatar that simply does not overly care much about the Mage in question, while Avatar 5 could mean a young Avatar that's throwing all its weight into the Mage's life.<br /> In the end the reason for a particular Avatar rating is up to what a player comes up with - lots of room for interpretation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T22:33:51-08:00","id":1345709,"title":"","content":"The default M20 assumption is that Avatar Background = Strength but as others have mentioned it can be widely varied and I think it should be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25315-jihelu","name":"Jihelu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T09:56:10-08:00","id":1347268,"title":"","content":"I think that while there are some broad ideas as far as mechanics go (1 is a fairly low level avatar that doesn't exert strong influence, whilst a level 5 avatar would be VERY hard to ignore) it's one of those things they expect you to role play. Which means it probably depends on the Storyteller and player and what they work out between themselves.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25533-mister_dunpeal","name":"Mister_Dunpeal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T07:16:51-07:00","id":1393776,"title":"","content":"I read once before, that the Avatar rating represent how fitting the nature of the avatar is to the true nature of the Mage. Like a 5 Dot Avatar is nearly perfectly matched a Zero Dot Avatar is like he just got one that whas available to let him use Magick so that he at least can use it despite the Avatar is so dimetral that the mage is totally ignoring him instinctivly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}